; ALVIE/VaultLink: learning and comparing models of services that speak a line-based text protocol (the language
; VTDL, the system under learning, the models, the services in memory and the commands). It needs no Unix library;
; vaultlink-unix adds the transport over TCP.
(library
 (name vaultlink)
 (public_name alvie-core.vaultlink)
 (modules symbol session vtdl observe service model memory_service commands)
 (preprocess (pps ppx_jane))
 (libraries core learninglib logs logs.fmt time_now))
